    "- **Activities:** Operational timeline and comments (24h summary and forecast)\n",
    "- **Casings & Pore Pressures:** Casing IDs/ODs and equivalent mud weight\n",
    "- **Equipment & Logs:** Equipment failure logs and wireline service records\n",
    "- **Geology & Bits:** Drill bit records, stratigraphy formations, and lithology shows\n",
    "\n",
    "We test it on a sample report and pretty-print the extracted data as indented JSON."
