    "### Step 3: Semantic Section Chunking Across the Archive\n",
    "In this step, we loop through all 32 daily drilling reports and break them into clean, self-contained semantic chunks based on their WITSML operational sections (`statusInfo`, `activity`, `fluid`, `surveyStation`, `porePressure`, `casing_liner_tubing`, `equipFailureInfo`, `bitRecord`, `logInfo`).\n",
    "\n",
